  "name": "Moored Autonomous Hydrophone Array Data from the Gulf of Alaska at 50°N and 135°W (PMEL Vents)",
  "description": "Hydrophone data can be obtained by time range, original position/time, and 1-day files via ftp. An autonomous hydrophone was deployed and collection of data files began October 1999\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: To monitor the global ocean through underwater acoustics.",
